152	     * fiscal year of today and the fiscal year of the owner's registration date. A newly created
153	     * owner registered in the current fiscal year therefore has a tenure of zero, and an owner with
154	     * no registration date is treated as having zero tenure. Used to gate the tenure membership
155	     * points, which require a tenure of one or more elapsed fiscal years.
